📘 File Vault Project Documentation
1. Overview

file_vault_proj is a secure file vault application designed to handle:

File storage with deduplication (via SHA-256 hashing).

User authentication (bcrypt + JWT).

File metadata management (per-user files, references, sharing).

PostgreSQL database backend with migrations.

RESTful API built in Go (Golang).

Modern frontend with React + TypeScript.

Containerized using Docker Compose for local development.

2. Tech Stack

Backend: Go (net/http, sqlx, bcrypt, JWT)

Database: PostgreSQL (with golang-migrate for migrations)

Frontend: React + TypeScript (Vite)

Containerization: Docker Compose

Testing: Smoke test scripts (Bash & PowerShell), Postman collection

